Package: bentrix
Type: Package
Title: BENTRIX's Engine in Your Own R Session, and Its Gym
Version: 0.1.361
Description: The embedded BENTRIX through its C ABI (crates/bentrix-ffi): the venue, the replay clock
    that cannot look ahead, the recordings, and the Gym as a client of BENTRIX's own environment.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: jsonlite
NeedsCompilation: yes
SystemRequirements: the BENTRIX C ABI library (libbentrix), its folder in BENTRIX_FFI_DIR and its
    header's in BENTRIX_FFI_INCLUDE at install
